<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs up $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs up $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said early bids on barrows and gilts were $0.50 to $1.00 higher. Top $56.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs 55.00-56.50.</p>
